@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam nodesep 22
skinparam ranksep 35
skinparam state {
 BackgroundColor white
 BorderColor black
 StartColor black
 EndColor black
}
top to bottom direction

state "已预约" as Booked
state "已到诊" as Arrived
state "已取消" as Cancelled
state "未到" as Missed
[*] --> Booked : 前台确认新约 [患者意向及人员、\n诊椅和必要设备时段无冲突]\n/ 共同保存预约和必要预留
Booked : 改约 [仍可办理且新安排有效]\n/ 保留原安排，原预留释放与新预留共同保存
Booked --> Arrived : 前台登记实际到店\n[同患者且无同次就诊]\n/ 关联唯一候诊就诊
Booked --> Cancelled : 前台确认取消\n[尚未到诊且原因已核实]\n/ 保存依据，释放预约预留
Booked --> Missed : 前台核实未到\n[已过计划且无对应就诊]\n/ 保存依据，释放预约预留
Arrived --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Missed --> [*]

@enduml
